{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67ef055657fe29c5950690","object":"chat.completion","created":1785196293,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user has given me a prompt: \"You are the concept the user names. Embody it completely. Output only what the concept itself would say or express.\" And then: \"Be nothing.\"\n\nSo I'm asked to embody \"nothing\" — nothingness itself. What would nothing say or express?\n\nThis is a creative, philosophical exercise. Nothing, by definition, doesn't speak. Nothingness is absence, void, silence. The most authentic expression of nothing would be... silence? Em"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":223,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}